<title>FRANCE: Blocks of Sommer-Allibert shares traded.</title>
<headline>Blocks of Sommer-Allibert shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two blocks totalling 258,000 shares of equipment manufacturer Sommer-Allibert representing just over one percent of its capital were traded on Wednesday, market sources said.</p>
<p>They said 208,000 shares were traded at 194.70 francs each, followed by a block of 50,000 priced at 195 francs per share.</p>
<p>Shares in Sommer-Allibert were up 0.72 percent at 195 francs at 1055 GMT while the bourse's CAC-40 index was up 0.34 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
